<section class="admin-content">
  <div class="admin-section-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Restricted · Super administrator</span><h2>Staff access</h2><p>Grant dashboard access to an existing active customer or review current staff. Changes are recorded in the audit log; the last active super administrator is protected.</p></div></div>
